> levels only after §13.2's manifold-level refutation); Face B (the
> ℂ³-leg color face, with confinement-shaped signature = conductor-3
> packet cubic isolation); Face C (the \(i\)-face, carrying the
> \(\hbar\)-role constant) — together with a central inter-leg
> normalization mode whose face-or-mode status is an explicit open
> bookkeeping item (Paper 18 Prop 5.1), plus exactly one
> irreducibly-external bit, the chirality \(\mathbb Z_2\) locked to
> \(\gamma^5\) (Paper 33 §3 Chirality Boundary); and the only constants
> the \(c\)–\(\hbar\) pair can yield are conductor-fixed pure numbers,
> never a dimensionful magnitude — the Compton wavelength is the named
> firewall trap of the pair, and target 1 of the constants taxonomy
