> \(\mathbb Z/6\) at the anchored Paper 20 Definition 2.1.* The
> corollary is exactly as strong as the conjunction of its named
> conjuncts; every failure path lands on a stated weaker count, never on
> silence.

**Keywords:** information geometry, categorical effective action, cumulant
tower, Amari–Chentsov tensor, Nambu–Fisher mechanics, projection-closure
certificate, conductor packets, Cartan exhaustion, dimensional selection,
Galilean–Lorentzian lift, Souriau cocycle, Bures completion, simplex mass term,
Weil positivity.

