| 6 | \(\mathbb Z/3\) | color |
| 9 | \(\mathbb Z/2\) | chirality |
| 18 | trivial | base |

**Step 3 — The SM-gauge-center scaling law.**
Comparing across rows (every row with \(6\mid N\)):

| Row | \(m\) for SM \(\mathbb Z/6\) | \(m\) for color \(\mathbb Z/3\) | \(m\) for chirality \(\mathbb Z/2\) |
|---|---|---|---|
