below the next primorial Z/30 and exposes a striking new structural
feature: the cubic-gauge Kummer deck is \(\mathbb Z/8\), the Bott-
periodicity period of real K-theory.

**Conductor packet structure.** Divisors of 24 \(>1\): \(\{2,3,4,6,8,12,24\}\):

