By CRT \((\mathbb Z/24)^\times=(\mathbb Z/8)^\times\times(\mathbb Z/3)^\times
=(\mathbb Z/2\times\mathbb Z/2)\times\mathbb Z/2=(\mathbb Z/2)^3\), since
\((\mathbb Z/8)^\times\cong\mathbb Z/2\times\mathbb Z/2\) (the Klein
4-group, even though \(\mathbb Z/8\) itself is cyclic). \(\varphi(24)=8\).

