| **Z/24** | **\((\mathbb Z/2)^3\)** (three independent parities) | **8** |
| Z/30 | \(\mathbb Z/2\times\mathbb Z/4\) | 8 |

**Z/24 is the unique row with multiplicative-unit group \((\mathbb Z/2)^3\)
— three independent parity-like operators.** Distinct from every other
row in v0.2.5.

**Step 3 — Kummer-cover deck groups at integer gauges.** Per-coordinate
