**Step 4 — The striking new content: \(\mathbb Z/8\) at the cubic gauge.**

At Z/24, the **cubic / Amari–Chentsov gauge \(m=3\) has Kummer-cover
deck group \(\mathbb Z/8\)** — a structure not seen at any other row
considered so far:

| Row | Deck at cubic gauge \(m=3\) |
