- **C. KO-dimension assignment:** The \(\mathbb Z/8\) at cubic gauge IS
  the Bott-periodicity period, and Z/24 is the row where the framework
  specifies KO-dim 6 for SM.
- **D. \(\mathbb Z/8\) anomaly:** Witten's \(\mathbb Z/8\)-anomaly
  classification of time-reversal-invariant topological phases of
  fermions appears at depth-3 of prime 2.

**The framework predicts depth-3 EW structure exists** with \(\mathbb Z/8\)
Kummer content at the cubic gauge. *Which* of A/B/C/D is the right
physical interpretation is phenomenological matching, not framework-
derivable.

**Step 6 — Updated primorial-and-depth hierarchy.**

| Row | \(N\) | Depth on (2,3,...) | New packet | Physical-scale candidate |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Z/6 | 6 | (1, 1) | (base) | SM scale |
