    Minkowski norm \(\det M=(x^0)^2-|\mathbf x|^2\), which is precisely
    the local Lorentzian quadratic form of the §13.2A sub-bundle. The
    \(\mathrm{SL}(2,\mathbb C)\) real form is therefore realized at the
    *infinitesimal/tangent* level (as a quadratic form on the relevant
    sub-bundle), even though it does not extend to a manifold-level
    group action.

